# The image builds copy the repository root as their context (deploy/images/*).
# Keep the host's dependency trees, build output, secrets and scratch out of
# it: a copied pnpm symlink farm breaks the in-image install, and nothing
# below is needed to build an image.
.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/.svelte-kit
**/build
**/dist
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.exe
**/*.log
deploy/secrets
deploy/.env
docs
*.md
!deploy/**/*.md
